DESCRIPTION >
    One row per episode start (event `episode_started`), with the lessons shown in that episode's prompt.
    `active_lesson_ids[i]` is sha256(normalized `active_lessons[i]`)[:16]; the same text always has the same id.

TOKEN "agent_telemetry_append" APPEND

SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3) `json:$.timestamp`,
    `event_id` String `json:$.event_id`,
    `run_id` String `json:$.run_id`,
    `model` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.model`,
    `learning_enabled` Bool `json:$.learning_enabled`,
    `episode_id` String `json:$.episode_id`,
    `episode_index` UInt32 `json:$.episode_index`,
    `seed` Int64 `json:$.seed`,
    `task` String `json:$.task`,
    `known_lesson_count` UInt32 `json:$.known_lesson_count`,
    `active_lesson_ids` Array(String) `json:$.active_lesson_ids[:]`,
    `active_lessons` Array(String) `json:$.active_lessons[:]`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY toYYYYMM(timestamp)
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY run_id, episode_index
